                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN FÜR EINEN SCHÄUMUNGSPROZESS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉS POUR UN PROCESSUS DE MOUSSAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM FOR A FOAMING PROCESS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An automated injection molding process includes an injecting device adapted to couple the plurality of molds to inject a molten polymeric material into a cavity of the molds. A nozzle of the injecting device is adapted with a pressure sensor. The pressure sensor is included in a pressure feedback loop that relays a pressure of the nozzle to a controller. The controller instructs an electronically actuated screw of the injecting device to rotate and push the polymeric material into the cavity at a rate that maintains the cavity pressure at a pressure according to a preset pressure profile. A barrel of the injecting device, configured to store the polymeric material and including heating devices to heat the barrel, is adapted with a temperature sensor. The controller commands adjustment of the heating of the barrel to maintain the temperature of polymeric material at a melt temperature of the material.</p>
            </abstract>
